  {
    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Escrows `amount` XLM and buys once `min_out` tokens can be had for it, after fees. `kind` is LIMIT, ON_GRADUATION or\\nDCA, which fills in `slices` parts at least `interval` seconds apart.",
