    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Escrows `amount` tokens and sells once they fetch at least `min_out` XLM, after fees. `kind` is LIMIT, STOP (with\\n`trigger` XLM for the whole order), TRAILING (with `trail_bps`), ON_GRADUATION or ON_DEV_SELL (with `trail_bps`, the share\\nof their holding the creator must sell).",
